Title:          lswt.tcz
Description:    list wayland toplevels
Version:        2.0.0
Author:         see list of sites below
Original-site:  see list of sites below
Copying-policy: see list of sites below
Size:		12K
Extension_by:   gnuser
Tags:           wayland wlrctl xdotool wmctrl windows
Comments:       ----------
                - similar to "wlrctl toplevel list", but can also show unique window identifiers
                - for example, to show app-id, title, and unique identifier of all windows:
                  $ lswt -c ati
                - works with wayland compositors that support foreign-toplevel-management-unstable-v1 (e.g., labwc)
